Gears of War 3: green colours in in-engine cutscenes at 2x internal resolution. Cutscenes build the
colour grading table with another pixel shader (65DF74D4BE69FC68, computed rather than sampled from
a strip); it joins 5FD384E4DE20CAC8 in the gpu_guest_pixel_center_ps default.

